Antibodies used for immunoblotting are as follows: Rat α-FLAG L5 (#637303; BioLegend), Rabbit α-HA, Rabbit α-GFP, Rabbit α-Sec62, Rabbit α-Sec63, Rabbit α-Sec61β, Rabbit α-BAG6, and Rabbit α-Sec61α (
Chitwood et al., 2018
;
Mariappan et al., 2010
