g
for 15 min at 4°C. For co-IP, the supernatant was rotated with StrepTactin-XT beads (IBA) for 2 h at 4°C. The beads were washed three times with 1 ml of wash buffer (50 mM Tris, pH 8.0, 150 mM NaCl, 5 mM MgAc, 0.1% digitonin). The bound material was eluted from the beads by directly boiling in 50 μl of 2× SDS sample buffer for 5 min and analyzed by immunoblotting. The interaction between Sec63-FLAG and Sec61 translocon shown in
Fig. S1 D
